; ABNF mirror (descriptive, not test-parsed — the real byte-level walker is
; ../📡️component.protocol.semio, walked by dsl::walk_protocol) for s.stdio.semio.mesh diff
; (binary) — REAL `DiffCodec::encode_diff`/`decode_diff` frame, replacing the old
; `print_diff().into_bytes()` text-as-binary shortcut.
document = format presence payload
format   = OCTET     ; DIFF_BINARY_FORMAT, currently 1
presence = OCTET     ; bit0=meshes, bit1=materials, bit2=textures
payload  = *OCTET    ; 0-3 varint-length-prefixed UTF-8 blobs, one per bit set in `presence`
